i.github.com/users/Frozenfire92","html_url":"https://github.com/Frozenfire92","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-17T14:44:49Z","updated_at":"2025-05-17T14:44:49Z","body":"I've been working on the EditorLog and thinking about how best to prevent adding more buttons to the interface (when its already tight on small screen/window sizes). I think keeping this as a shortcut makes a lot of sense, which I have added in [9a348ab](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106500/commits/9a348ab34a83812eeebe530210057ea5b5801308)\r\n\r\nI think it might make sense to have a separate proposal for the EditorLog interface changes to prevent scope creep from this PR, and allow it to get the thought and intention it deserves.\r\n\r\nWith the change in [9a348ab](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106500/commits/9a348ab34a83812eeebe530210057ea5b5801308) it works, however there is a slight nuance of the selection always taking precedence when the shortcut is initiated outside of the Script window. I think this is probably fine but if there is a nice way to fix this I'd be happy to change it.\r\n\r\n[2025-05-17-00.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cc027a1a-adfd-41fe-8cd3-a0033893443c)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.c